    "三档价格对比表" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Three-tier price comparison table"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "三档价格对比表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一轮 12 个用例里有 **2 个失败**：\n\n1. 发言轮次在 5 人以上时，第 6 位的顺序被排到了最前——队列按加入时间排序，但重连的人会拿到新的时间戳。\n2. 登录回调走了旧网关，超时后没有重试。\n\n第一个建议改成按首次加入时间排序，改动在 `scheduler/queue.ts`：\n\n```ts\nqueue.sort((a, b) => a.firstJoinedAt - b.firstJoinedAt)\n```\n\n第二个需要把回调地址换成统一网关。\n\n另外顺手看了一眼覆盖率：scheduler 目录是 71%，主要缺重连和超时两条路径。两个失败修好后，我可以补上这两条的用例，大概再加 6 个测试。\n\n要我先改第一个吗？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the last run, **2 of 12 cases failed**:\n\n1. In rooms of 5+, the 6th person was sorted to the front. The queue sorts by join time, but anyone who reconnects gets a new timestamp.\n2. The login callback goes through the old gateway and doesn’t retry after a timeout.\n\nI suggest fixing the first by sorting on first-join time, in `scheduler/queue.ts`:\n\n```ts\nqueue.sort((a, b) => a.firstJoinedAt - b.firstJoinedAt)\n```\n\nThe second needs the callback URL switched to the unified gateway.\n\nI also glanced at coverage: the scheduler directory is at 71%, mostly missing the reconnect and timeout paths. Once the two failures are fixed, I can add cases for those two, about 6 more tests.\n\nShall I start with the first one?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上一轮 12 个用例里有 **2 个失败**：\n\n1. 发言轮次在 5 人以上时，第 6 位的顺序被排到了最前——队列按加入时间排序，但重连的人会拿到新的时间戳。\n2. 登录回调走了旧网关，超时后没有重试。\n\n第一个建议改成按首次加入时间排序，改动在 `scheduler/queue.ts`：\n\n```ts\nqueue.sort((a, b) => a.firstJoinedAt - b.firstJoinedAt)\n```\n\n第二个需要把回调地址换成统一网关。\n\n另外顺手看了一眼覆盖率：scheduler 目录是 71%，主要缺重连和超时两条路径。两个失败修好后，我可以补上这两条的用例，大概再加 6 个测试。\n\n要我先改第一个吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
